<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian companies ex-dividend today.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian companies ex-dividend today.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following companies are</p>
<p>ex-dividend today, according to the Australian Stock Exchange:</p>
<p>    Pacific Comms	3.00 cents</p>
<p>    Pasminco	     3.00 cents</p>
<p>    Strategic Minerals 1.50 cents</p>
<p>    Sydney Aquarium    9.75 cents</p>
<p>    Walker Corporation 1.10 cents</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
